<title>NORWAY: Norway's April PPI fell 0.2 pct mnth/mnth.</title>
<headline>Norway's April PPI fell 0.2 pct mnth/mnth.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> NORWAY PRODUCER PRICES    APRIL 1997 MARCH 1997 APRIL 1996</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	  -0.2	 -0.3	+0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	    +0.5	 +1.0	+2.1</p>
<p> Index (base 1981)	     159.9	160.2     159.1</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
